 hiperproteico refers to a high-protein supplement that has been studied for its effects on patients with respiratory conditions, particularly in improving muscle mass and strength.", "SOCIEDAD ESPAÑOLA DE MEDICINA INTENSIVA, CRÍTICA Y UNIDADES CORONARIAS:The Sociedad Española de Medicina Intensiva, Crítica y Unidades Coronarias (SEMICYUC) provides guidelines and recommendations for nutritional support in critically ill patients with respiratory failure.", "SOCIEDAD ESPAÑOLA DE NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL Y ENTERAL:The Sociedad Española de Nutrición Parenteral y Enteral (SENPE) is an organization dedicated to establishing quality criteria for clinical nutrition. It plays a crucial role in providing recommendations for nutritional support specifically aimed at patients who require artificial nutrition. Through its efforts, SENPE aims to enhance the standards and practices related to parenteral and enteral nutrition in clinical settings.", "SÍNDROME DE DISTRÉS RESPIRATORIO DEL ADULTO:The Síndrome de Distrés Respiratorio del Adulto (SDRA) is a condition that requires specific nutritional support strategies to improve patient outcomes.", "AGENTES NUTRICIONALES:Agentes nutricionales refer to the specific nutrients and formulas used in nutritional support for patients with respiratory conditions.", "AG MONOINSATURADOS:AG monoinsaturados are specific fatty acids that can improve metabolic control in patients with concurrent diabetes or hyperglycemia.", "FALLO RESPIRATORIO AGUDO:", "IVACAFTOR:Ivacaftor is a medication specifically designed to treat cystic fibrosis in patients who have certain mutations. It works by correcting the function of the RTFQ protein, which leads to improvements in lung function and nutritional status for these patients.", "LACTOBACILLUS GG:Lactobacillus GG is a strain of probiotic bacteria known for its potential health benefits. It has been shown to have a beneficial effect in the prevention of atopic dermatitis, although its effectiveness in addressing 